WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
What advice would you give to them about,

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.800
if they want to try to do something big in this world,

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.720
they want to really have a big positive impact,

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.280
what advice would you give them about their career,

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.760
maybe about life in general?

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:15.760
Try to be useful.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.360
Do things that are useful to your fellow human beings,

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.480
to the world.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.040
It's very hard to be useful.

